            </tr>

            <tr>
                <th>Assessment</th>
                <td>Assessment 1 – Digital Portfolio (Phase 1)</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <th>Student</th>
                <td>Bharat Doodi</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <th>Semester</th>
                <td>Semester 1</td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
                <th>Weighting</th>
                <td>15% of total module mark</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>


    <!-- SECTION 4: FEATURES -->
    <div class="readme-section">
        <h2>3. Features of the Portfolio</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Home page</li>
            <li>About page</li>
            <li>Education page</li>
            <li>Professional Knowledge page</li>
            <li>Projects page</li>
            <li>Pictures Gallery</li>
            <li>Video Gallery</li>
            <li>Blog functionality</li>
            <li>User registration and login</li>
            <li>Instant messaging facility</li>
            <li>Responsive CSS design</li>
            <li>Server-side routing</li>
            <li>README documentation page</li>
        </ul>
    </div>


    <!-- SECTION 5: PHASE 1 -->
    <div class="readme-section">
        <h2>4. Phase 1 Features</h2>

        <div class="phase-box">
            <h3>Phase 1 – Core Portfolio</h3>

            <ul>
                <li>Home</li>
                <li>About</li>
                <li>Education</li>
                <li>Professional Knowledge</li>
                <li>Projects</li>
                <li>Picture Gallery</li>
                <li>Video Gallery</li>
                <li>Navigation bar</li>
                <li>Responsive CSS design</li>
                <li>Page routing</li>
                <li>README documentation</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>


    <!-- SECTION 6: PHASE 2 -->
    <div class="readme-section">
        <h2>5. Phase 2 Features</h2>

        <div class="phase-box">
            <h3>Phase 2 – Extended Functionality</h3>

            <ul>
                <li>Blog functionality</li>
                <li>User authentication</li>
                <li>Database integration</li>
                <li>Instant messaging</li>
                <li>Advanced user interaction</li>
                <li>Future enhancements and additional services</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>


    <!-- SECTION 7: SOFTWARE ARCHITECTURE -->
    <div class="readme-section">
        <h2>6. Software Architecture</h2>

        <p>
            The portfolio follows a client-server web application structure.
            The browser sends requests to the Express server, which handles
            routing and serves the required pages.
        </p>

        <h3>Architecture Flow</h3>

        <div class="project-structure">
Browser
   ↓
Express.js Server
   ↓
Routing
   ↓
EJS Views
   ↓
CSS / JavaScript / Images
   ↓
Database / External Services
        </div>
    </div>


    <!-- SECTION 8: CONTROL FLOW -->
    <div class="readme-section">
        <h2>7. Control Flow</h2>

        <p>
            The general control flow of the application is:
        </p>

        <div class="project-structure">
User visits website
        ↓
HTTP request sent to server
        ↓
Express route identified
        ↓
Required data/content processed
        ↓
EJS page rendered
        ↓
HTML/CSS/JavaScript returned
        ↓
User interacts with the page
        </div>
    </div>


    <!-- SECTION 9: COMPONENTS -->
    <div class="readme-section">
        <h2>8. Main Components</h2>

        <ul>
            <li><strong>Express.js</strong> – Backend web framework</li>
            <li><strong>Node.js</strong> – Runtime environment</li>
            <li><strong>EJS</strong> – Dynamic HTML templating</li>
            <li><strong>CSS</strong> – Page styling and responsive layout</li>
            <li><strong>JavaScript</strong> – Client-side interactions</li>
            <li><strong>MongoDB</strong> – Database functionality</li>
            <li><strong>Crisp</strong> – Instant messaging/chat facility</li>
        </ul>
    </div>


    <!-- SECTION 10: PROJECT STRUCTURE -->
    <div class="readme-section">
        <h2>9. Project Structure</h2>

        <div class="project-structure">
portfolio-website-CS5709-SEM-1/
│
