        </p>
    </div>


    <!-- SECTION 12: EVALUATION -->
    <div class="readme-section">
        <h2>11. Evaluation</h2>

        <p>
            The portfolio successfully implements the major requirements of
            the Digital Portfolio assessment. The application provides a
            structured navigation system, multiple portfolio pages,
            multimedia galleries, blog functionality and interactive services.
        </p>

        <div class="score-box">
            <strong>Critical Review:</strong>

            <p>
                The current system provides a functional foundation, but
                further improvements can be made in accessibility, advanced
                authentication, database security, testing coverage and
                deployment monitoring.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>


